00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
The Jazz Singer is a drama, music, romance film directed by Richard Fleischer.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
A young Jewish man is torn between tradition and individuality when his
old-fashioned family objects to his career as a jazz singer.

4
